efeat the boss to choose one<strong>\u00a0of 3 Curse Cards</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curses are negative modifiers that reshape your run and escalate difficulty</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>Merchant</strong> appears at key milestones</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend <strong>Teeth</strong> dropped by enemies to buy power-ups, healing, and other run-saving tools</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you survive, the more your build is tested\u2014and the more legendary it becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LEVEL-UP CARDS: YOUR BUILD IS YOUR POWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is shaped by choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you level up:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 random upgrade cards</strong> appear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick one to strengthen your build</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades can enhance:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abilities</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Gear</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Glyphs\u00a0</strong>(HP, shield, armor, crit, and more)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each item has a <strong>max level</strong>, so committing to one path means sacrificing another\u2014making every run feel personal and strategic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/d29f31bace01b2fdd65b2dd116ae0505.poster.avif?t=1768074524\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/d29f31bace01b2fdd65b2dd116ae0505.webm?t=1768074524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/d29f31bace01b2fdd65b2dd116ae0505.mp4?t=1768074524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SYNERGIES: THE MOMENT YOUR BUILD \u201cCLICKS\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your gear to its peak and unlock <strong>Synergies</strong>\u2014powerful transformations that change how your weapons and abilities behave.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Synergy paths for every weapon and ability</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each path supports a different playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergies turn strong builds into signature builds</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the number of combinations across upgrades, stats, tactical gear, and Synergies, every character supports thousands of viable build possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROGRESSION, UNLOCKS, AND REPLAY GOALS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bug Alliance rewards every run\u2014win or lose.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reveal 13-chapter breathtaking story of Bug Alliance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons, abilities, and characters gain <strong>Rank</strong> the more you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranking up improves performance and unlocks <strong>skins</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock additional bug characters by meeting gameplay conditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>Challenges</strong> (achievement-style goals) and <strong>Tasks</strong> (extra objectives during runs) for more rewards and long-term goals</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE LORE BOOK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the world behind the war.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reveal campaign story chapters by clearing maps on <strong>Hard</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock character lore entries by meeting their unique conditions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/d1a3aacc41fafdbd464282c8b99005ec.poster.avif?t=1768074524\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/d1a3aacc41fafdbd464282c8b99005ec.webm?t=1768074524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/d1a3aacc41fafdbd464282c8b99005ec.mp4?t=1768074524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more to be decided together with our great community</p>","developers":["Ent-Re Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/fb583a32d10f88f124185146c250b953aa790027/header.jpg?t=1768074524","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Ent-Re Games | All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3018360/1166334716/9c279706873309dd5fe60d334a249610a8cf39e2/1754478120/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754480134","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3018360/1166334716/9c279706873309dd5fe60d334a249610a8cf39e2/1754478120/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754480134","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/